Omarchy brand artwork
=====================

assets/omarchy-logo.svg reproduces the official Omarchy logo
from https://omarchy.org/brand/omarchy-logo.svg, linked by
https://omarchy.org/brand/ and retrieved on 12 September 2026 (UTC).
Its geometry and published #9ece6a fill are unchanged.

assets/solitaire.svg combines original card artwork with
that same official logo, scaled without changing its geometry.

The Omarchy brand page states: "Omarchy is a pending trademark. All rights
reserved." These marks are not relicensed under this project's MIT license.
This is a community application; it does not claim Foundation endorsement.

The playing-card faces and back patterns are original Rust vector artwork.
No Microsoft card artwork, executables or game assets are included.

Rust dependencies retain their respective licenses. See THIRD_PARTY.md and
Cargo.lock for the dependency and license inventory.
